  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RESPEKT YLE 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RESPEKT YLE 2024 is a youth leader project aimed at supporting the Team RESPEKT partnership project. The target is to promote an internal dialogue about the sustainability of our programs within the partner organisations and in the project structure. The Youth Leaders will get to strengthen the Resource mobilisation capabilities of the partnership, collect videos and audio materials from the field visits and organise a 3 day convention with delegates who are volunteers in the project to discuss the sustainability of our interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
